{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the sequence defined recursively by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/f/e0f391c58262373a0359ceb5a180b28d65fd677a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_1=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"10\" /> (any positive number), and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/c/e3c36993c00d29a526d4b35b3b167df1bd957700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_{n+1}=-1/(u_n+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/8/e88831557651694d152b65db1ff4b5fd2d5e237b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1,2,3,...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" /> For which of the following values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/a/06a2f86a7e423ca3064877f66a87fb87ec5642fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_n=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/257b44abbfea475d5ebff978ae0b9e8e2a7263fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ 14 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ 15 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ 16 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 17 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ 18 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Repeatedly applying the function, and simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac1570c9c46b33133c71b978c29a848e6864565.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a,\\quad-\\frac1{a+1},\\quad-\\frac{a+1}a,\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"38\" />and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> again. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must appear at every third term after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/5/0559ffc8c62a08ff533f3fcd1a5c1713a520755d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" />. The only option given of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c33f7b876e0d56c3c01d50e6a673f33edc70578f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+3k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/c/14cf35351be7d46fedf38c754bc5df48ac194088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\,16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"60\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHS